e1baccec', '2024-12-04T02:27:54.956Z', NULL, '2024-06-21T22:08:05.071Z', 'Tantur paulo dividit tamendum rem mundi sit nihil.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('1ab2a23f-1528-518e-8c83-a595133e69fe', 'a63ee1e7-2952-5b6a-b77f-32c7b98f91aa', '2024-12-30T19:18:29.603Z', NULL, '2024-12-26T19:16:38.445Z', 'Capti arbitrium sic viam expectantur.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('b04ae420-74ad-5ebb-9eb0-03473c02dbc6', 'fb5979c4-1bc3-5699-8ca4-936db718d953', '2024-01-03T19:45:19.039Z', NULL, '2024-05-18T05:11:21.026Z', 'Quod tribuatur stoicis perpaulo in earum sus nostra.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('cbfb91dd-2f68-58b4-a542-d0e6f48bd685', '341863d1-08b9-5913-b844-01174fcb29c1', '2024-08-13T02:31:25.318Z', NULL, '2024-08-31T01:23:45.139Z', 'Exissimam delectis irca patiens mei sapiena solum.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('38ce8047-a72a-5425-ac89-0f7528d589e3', 'c700fac1-d724-5769-aa42-6a9ca3a01880', '2024-12-23T00:23:04.344Z', NULL, '2024-01-16T17:24:52.586Z', 'In causas quo propter et.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('5e8eb322-e373-5041-b59a-02fef5dc140f', '13b0eac3-b0f9-5efa-be00-d5add144d56d', '2024-02-22T20:29:26.797Z', NULL, '2024-12-04T02:21:46.913Z', 'Ilium ius discipitur il eum confirmitat gloriat, sua ducem ut caecatum qui oribus locis fuisse.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('bcd6613b-61f6-50df-8c2d-73c057af432f', 'aa20a8ae-a665-593d-b66d-9a2b4f76e8cc', '2024-09-02T07:15:34.390Z', NULL, '2024-11-22T20:21:21.186Z', 'Amiculis inquit tur cognitioque vide a vitae quod.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('a4bbab4f-aaa2-5100-9497-7371c6804255', '4fd49153-5b21-56c0-9f03-72665852d54c', '2024-08-18T19:38:28.296Z', NULL, '2024-02-09T06:19:56.863Z', 'Ob natur si crudelli quibusant negatio, praesere vel mihi volum ne gravit nisi.', NULL, DEFAULT, '2023-12-31T12:00:00.000Z', DEFAULT), ('6807775b-3d4d-5c7a-990d-ae9058